    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Heritage Signature (RFI v1.0).</strong></p><p><em>&ldquo;Gate-Warden.&rdquo;</em></p><p><strong>The Gate Knows You.</strong> 1/Soma Break, as a reaction: when a creature within 30 ft attempts to open, close, lock, unlock, cross, or pass through a door, gate, threshold, ley-line gate, or named boundary, the creature rerolls their highest die on any check related to the crossing and takes the lower. The gate heard who you are before it felt them coming.</p>",
